text:
The participants are strongly advised by the BSC Organising Committee to attend all training sessions. The training programme is intended to help participants:
• Upgrade their technical knowledge and skills;
• Understand the principles of vehicle design and engineering;
• Design, build and test their prototype effectively;
• Improve the performance, reliability and safety of their vehicle; and
• Successfully complete the evaluation tests and obtain certification. Note: Maximum Training and Certification Score: 300 points (12 modules × 25 points per module).
